OL,3,GNEWSAHospital body cameras brought in
OL,4,Adue to violence
OL,5,
OL,6,FHospital staff are being given body
OL,7,Fcameras in the hope of deterring
OL,8,Fpatients from abusing them.
OL,10,FViolence and abuse are "one of the
OL,11,Fbiggest challenges" facing the NHS,
OL,12,Fsaid associate director of nursing at
OL,13,FUniversity Hospitals Tees Joanne
OL,14,FFoster, with staff being punched,
OL,15,Fkicked and racially threatened on a
OL,16,Fdaily basis.
OL,18,FThe cameras are now being introduced
OL,19,Ffor clinical staff in James Cook
OL,20,FUniversity Hospital's emergency
OL,21,Fdepartment to put patients off from
OL,22,Fbecoming aggressive.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,444,440,260,160,0,100
