OL,3,GNEWSAHospital body cameras brought in
OL,4,Adue to violence
OL,5,
OL,6,FFoster said the cameras helped
OL,7,Fde-escalate situations but the
OL,8,F"constant potential for aggression"
OL,9,Fdrove burnout, with more staff leaving
OL,10,Fthe NHS because of it than ever before.
